nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvK5ak6cSD6SikT_-5blVRuZeu37zxLrjydv65oLj4z3A&oe=69A2DF57"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jEekpsQErfIQ7kNvwGd3Chr&_nc_oc=Adly-hKWKbfCF6aPnIC5T1Yk85EA5LiFgTJKq2YEAWqVG5pD86uuz4dRnjcxnWtauss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvpwPPP9kt2kb7T5OsXgfWcWc9SZHpQkj39OdKoAnoQhw&oe=69A2E495"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Ovl9tiEaZAQ7kNvwGwLw55&_nc_oc=AdkmzBd4SZXFK7Rtk2M3GtTRdK-JtWMm6pVhjya-TSkodIdTDInPy3ubo1dN_oxttDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsBZMykGfFzj5DQhdinu5aU-brNUR5zTZJgC3QhdOeQhw&oe=69A2F842"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AOMGJZOFRdsQ7kNvwGh8V7x&_nc_oc=Adn9Qolcc7ZUoyNr9KzBx365hdPPt2q8R4YE81_18Z4R0rXxaRVgeEKdzjX6keOBGnU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs-NmbOZXAQHt7wzufTQTKIkNOlY64HJtjHzRlDVzo27A&oe=69A2DEC4"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g-8GW6zYj94Q7kNvwE0UaCR&_nc_oc=AdnrXwRMRkA4Z_ra0VuVupb6I9AYd7w38DZyeQIyAA-iSPJ5pILt5Is_90E6jF4yBjQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfshKGRmL7MkFcRo1nj3hSB7Em6uiqrd0pKbIYN2wACdBA&oe=69A2D722"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "874968081049627", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003276_874968084382960_490444167917392231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u8loIQnZa8YQ7kNvwFGkn_3&_nc_oc=AdmRGVArUN4fTABn5iM8qE3D1_iheeKG7Y3yIWEZnRYB5JRTFcqusPTD3WuW9rfsbPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsdwFXCKC_bMtFIyiHqQwMlTVPB_P28qS